phonon dispersion with phononpy

steps

1. process POSCAR: `phonopy -d --dim 3 3 1 --pa auto`

2. submit the calculations

3. create FORCE_SETS
    unix: `phonopy -f $(ls dp-*/vasprun.xml | sort -V)`
    windows: `phonopy --vasp -f (Get-ChildItem -Directory -Filter "pd-*" | Sort-Object { [int]($_.Name -replace '^pd-','') } | ForEach-Object { "$($_.Name)\vasprun.xml" } | Where-Object { Test-Path $_ })`

4. generate band.yaml: `phonopy -p band.conf`

5. quick view: `phonopy-bandplot band.yaml -o band.pdf`

